@startuml
title FiscalWave — Chile personal data boundaries / Límites de datos personales (propuesto)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Individual data subject\nTitular de datos" as Subject
actor "Tenant organization\nEmpresa cliente" as Tenant
rectangle "FiscalWave (proposed)" {
  component "Tenant identity/roles\nOIDC + authorization" as Identity
  component "Fiscal Document Service\nlegal XML owner" as Fiscal
  component "Privacy request workflow\nDSAR + exception review" as Rights
  component "SII Connector" as Sii
  component "Audit / incident response\nredacted metadata" as Audit
  database "PostgreSQL scoped by tenant\nidempotency + indexes" as Pg
  folder "Private document storage\nsigned XML, PDF, retention" as Store
  folder "Credential vault\nPFX vs CAF separate" as Vault
  component "Optional Redis/Mongo\nnon-authoritative and controlled" as Cache
}
cloud "Chilean SII (authorized)" as SII
cloud "Approved processors/regions\ntransfer review required" as Vendors
Tenant --> Identity : login and role / acceso
Tenant --> Fiscal : create DTE / emitir
Fiscal --> Pg : transaction and indexes
Fiscal --> Store : signed XML / PDF
Fiscal --> Vault : authorized signing / claves
Fiscal --> Sii : authorized delivery / envío
Sii --> SII : SII tests/production if allowed
Fiscal --> Audit : safe audit / auditoría
Subject --> Rights : verified legal request / derechos
Rights --> Identity : eligibility, profile
Rights --> Pg : eligible personal metadata
Rights --> Store : tax retention legal review
Rights --> Audit : decision evidence
Identity --> Vendors : only assessed / proveedor autorizado
note bottom of Rights
No automatic deletion of signed XML.
Apply verified statutory exceptions
and record decision.
end note
note bottom of Vendors
Separate Git repositories do NOT
provide residency or transfer compliance.
end note
@enduml
